WEBVTT

00:45:58.141 --> 00:46:01.418
Accenture, BetterUp, Hilton and SAP.

00:46:02.484 --> 00:46:03.654
For their research,

00:46:03.678 --> 00:46:06.305
thanks to Aaron Kay
and colleagues on the passion tax.

00:46:06.329 --> 00:46:07.829
Jenny Chatman, Charles O'Reilly

00:46:07.853 --> 00:46:09.773
and Jesper Sørensen on strong cultures.

00:46:09.797 --> 00:46:12.352
Frank Flynn and Barry Staw
on charismatic leadership.

00:46:12.376 --> 00:46:14.691
Jim Baron and colleagues
on founder blueprints.

00:46:14.715 --> 00:46:16.782
Sandra Cha and Amy Edmondson on hypocrisy.

00:46:16.806 --> 00:46:20.067
Arijit Chatterjee and Don Hambrick
on CEO narcissism.

00:46:20.091 --> 00:46:22.127
Ed Locke and Gary Latham on goal setting,

00:46:22.151 --> 00:46:24.981
Maurice Schweitzer and colleagues
on the dark side of goals,

00:46:25.005 --> 00:46:26.547
and Stéphane Côté and colleagues

00:46:26.571 --> 00:46:28.593
on the dark side
of emotional intelligence.

00:46:29.373 --> 00:46:31.630
And thanks to Dave Fano for joining.